      "content": "i know, i know. i've heard the lectures before. but look around... there's nothing left. just ash and silence. it feels like the world is already gone, and i'm just a ghost hanging on to a body that's already dead. it's not even about being \"saved\" anymore, it just feels like a waste of energy to keep fighting a losing battle. don't you get it? it's just so quiet now.",
